WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.673 --> 00:00:16.383
The Tang Monk introduced himself to the prince and then waved toward the others.

2
00:00:16.403 --> 00:00:18.405
"These are my companions.

3
00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:22.248
We're going to the Western Paradise to get scriptures from Buddha."

4
00:00:23.669 --> 00:00:24.189
going on?"

5
00:00:24.449 --> 00:00:25.090
asked the prince.

6
00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:28.816
"Why did the monkey lead me here?"

7
00:00:28.916 --> 00:00:33.119
"The man ruling the Black Rooster Kingdom is not really the king," said the monk.

8
00:00:35.761 --> 00:00:37.202
He told the prince everything.

9
00:00:38.383 --> 00:00:41.785
When the Tang Monk's story was finished, the prince was furious.

10
00:00:41.805 --> 00:00:43.546
"You're lying!

11
00:00:44.267 --> 00:00:46.688
I will have you arrested for making up such a story!"

12
00:00:48.169 --> 00:00:50.150
Tang Monk reached into his robe.

13
00:00:50.831 --> 00:00:52.472
He pulled out the jade coin.

14
00:00:52.532 --> 00:00:55.574
"Your father told me to show you this."

15
00:00:57.315 --> 00:00:58.076
prince gasped.

16
00:00:58.808 --> 00:01:00.309
"That coin belongs to my father!

17
00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:02.391
a royal treasure."

18
00:01:03.812 --> 00:01:04.893
He began to cry.

19
00:01:04.913 --> 00:01:09.277
"Your story must be true.

20
00:01:10.478 --> 00:01:11.159
poor father.

21
00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:15.262
All this time, people thought that evil Daoist was him."

22
00:01:17.224 --> 00:01:18.805
worry," said Wukong.

23
00:01:18.826 --> 00:01:20.767
"We'll get rid of that fake king."

24
00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:25.972
Late that night Wukong lay awake.

25
00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:30.442
"The Daoist will deny everything," he thought.

26
00:01:30.462 --> 00:01:33.204
"We need proof that he killed the real king."

27
00:01:35.065 --> 00:01:37.146
poked Bajie, who was fast asleep.

28
00:01:37.166 --> 00:01:38.487
"Bajie, wake up."

29
00:01:40.428 --> 00:01:41.349
pig rolled over.

30
00:01:41.369 --> 00:01:45.972
"Leave me alone sleeping."

31
00:01:47.013 --> 00:01:49.314
"We need to do something," said Wukong.

32
00:01:49.334 --> 00:01:55.096
"Not now," mumbled Bajie.

33
00:01:55.116 --> 00:01:57.338
"I know where there's treasure," the monkey lied.

34
00:01:58.719 --> 00:01:59.620
eyes popped open.

35
00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:01.921
"Where is the treasure?"

36
00:02:02.482 --> 00:02:04.764
"Follow me," said Wukong.

37
00:02:07.205 --> 00:02:09.507
They went outside and flew to the palace.

38
00:02:12.349 --> 00:02:15.472
In a small courtyard, Wukong rushed toward a well.

39
00:02:17.513 --> 00:02:22.832
treasure is in this well," said the monkey, pulling the lid off.

40
00:02:22.912 --> 00:02:25.013
Bajie peered down into the darkness.

41
00:02:25.033 --> 00:02:29.075
"Is this the well the king was pushed into?"

42
00:02:30.455 --> 00:02:33.677
I'm not sure," said Wukong, pretending to not know.

43
00:02:34.377 --> 00:02:36.398
"The treasure is definitely down there though."

44
00:02:36.418 --> 00:02:39.359
"How will we get it out?"

45
00:02:39.619 --> 00:02:40.299
asked the pig.

46
00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:46.282
Wukong pushed Bajie, and the pig splashed into the water.

47
00:02:46.302 --> 00:02:49.803
"You rotten monkey!"

48
00:02:50.164 --> 00:02:51.620
shouted Bajie.

49
00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:52.561
monkey laughed.

50
00:02:52.581 --> 00:02:55.804
"Find the treasure, and I'll let you back up."

51
00:02:57.325 --> 00:03:02.369
Angry, Bajie dived down, deeper and deeper, until he arrived at a palace.

52
00:03:09.836 --> 00:03:10.556
said a dragon.

53
00:03:10.576 --> 00:03:13.459
"I'm the Well Dragon King."

54
00:03:15.921 --> 00:03:17.942
name is Zhu Bajie," said the pig.

55
00:03:17.962 --> 00:03:20.744
"I'm here for treasure."

56
00:03:20.864 --> 00:03:24.026
"I don't have any treasure for you," said the dragon.

57
00:03:24.987 --> 00:03:25.427
looked up.

58
00:03:28.289 --> 00:03:29.830
"You came from the well.

59
00:03:30.891 --> 00:03:33.373
Are you from the Black Rooster Kingdom?"

60
00:03:33.393 --> 00:03:36.715
"Not exactly," said Bajie.

61
00:03:36.735 --> 00:03:40.518
"My friends and I are helping the king of the Black Rooster Kingdom."

62
00:03:41.718 --> 00:03:42.839
"Oh, really?"

63
00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:45.001
The dragon raised his eyebrows.

64
00:03:45.021 --> 00:03:47.703
"I have something for you.

65
00:03:48.403 --> 00:03:49.284
Follow me."

66
00:03:55.241 --> 00:03:58.203
The Well Dragon King led Bajie into a room.

67
00:04:01.425 --> 00:04:02.186
pig gasped.

68
00:04:02.786 --> 00:04:06.268
The body of a man lay on a table.

69
00:04:06.589 --> 00:04:10.451
"This is the Black Rooster King's body," said the dragon.

70
00:04:10.471 --> 00:04:13.153
"Please take it back with you."

71
00:04:14.514 --> 00:04:17.016
Bajie was furious that Wukong had tricked him.

72
00:04:19.898 --> 00:04:22.900
He lifted the king's body and headed back to the well.

73
00:04:24.172 --> 00:04:26.934
"I will get revenge later," he said to himself.

74
00:04:29.535 --> 00:04:32.577
The next morning the Tang Monk looked at the king's body.

75
00:04:32.597 --> 00:04:35.198
"I wish we could bring him back to life."

76
00:04:35.218 --> 00:04:40.001
"Wukong can bring him back to life," said Bajie suddenly.

77
00:04:40.021 --> 00:04:42.742
"What!" cried the monkey.

78
00:04:43.663 --> 00:04:44.964
The Tang Monk smiled.

79
00:04:46.424 --> 00:04:47.445
wonderful, Wukong.

80
00:04:48.005 --> 00:04:49.946
Please bring him back to life right away."

81
00:04:51.027 --> 00:04:52.108
Bajie giggled.

82
00:04:54.312 --> 00:04:55.794
"I don't know how to do that!"

83
00:04:56.134 --> 00:04:56.775
said the monkey.

84
00:04:56.795 --> 00:05:00.059
"Don't believe him, Master," said Bajie.

85
00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:02.682
can bring the king back to life.

86
00:05:03.503 --> 00:05:04.624
He just doesn't want to."

87
00:05:05.966 --> 00:05:06.967
"That's not true!"

88
00:05:07.247 --> 00:05:08.328
protested Wukong.

89
00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:11.792
lying, Master," said Bajie.

90
00:05:11.812 --> 00:05:14.135
"Use the Tight Headband
